public/icons/*.png
# The SVGs are committed. They are plain text, fully reviewable, and they are
# what the deck, the README and anything outside the extension actually use —
# the ignore above exists for generated binaries, which an SVG is not.
!public/icons/*.svg
*.local
.DS_Store
public/ort/
# Copied out of node_modules by `npm run ocr-assets`, so reproducible from the
# lockfile. public/tessdata is NOT ignored: the language data is downloaded, and
# a build that reaches the network is a build that fails the day the network
# does — so it is committed alongside the face model.
public/tesseract/

